OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate school shuts for good
OL,4,Aduring half term
OL,5,
OL,6,FA century-old private school has
OL,7,Fannounced its closure at short notice.
OL,9,FLeweston School, near Sherborne,
OL,10,FDorset, posted on its website that it
OL,11,Fwould not reopen after half term, but
OL,12,Fgave no reason.
OL,14,FThe Catholic boarding and day school
OL,15,Fwrote: "We are very sorry for what this
OL,16,Fmeans for our pupils, their families
OL,17,Fand our staff, and for how little
OL,18,Fnotice we have been able to give."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
